    "movable": false,
    "movableInEdit": false,
    "css": "font-size: 25px",
    "html": "Every holder has a <b>layout</b> property that says in one word how it arranges the widgets you put into it. New holders start on &quotauto&quot. Pick another value in the <i>Layout</i> section of the property editor or in the JSON Editor. On &quotauto&quot the holder decides from its size: it centers what it holds, spreads it out when there is room, wraps it into the rows that keep the most of each card visible, and packs everything into one pile when only that still fits. <b>gridColumns</b>/<b>gridRows</b> pin how many cards go into a row. The centering, the squish and everything else about &quotauto&quot stays on."
  },
